{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa3362631f663272b329ba4ba3c2724ecfbe1ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_n=1+2+3+\\cdots +n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"192\" height=\"15\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1a851ae876f5c6fdd2ecf422cf34dea5012a5e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P_n=\\frac{T_2}{T_2-1}\\cdot\\frac{T_3}{T_3-1}\\cdot\\frac{T_4}{T_4-1}\\cdot\\cdots\\cdot\\frac{T_n}{T_n-1}\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"40\" />\nfor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/c/ecc34848ec9016d99298f465ba884cafe8ca34af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2,3,4,\\cdots,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6eda590334803ae998723964eb05455234408ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{1991}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" /> is closest to which of the following numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98ebcc276ad049e51baf105ded7e6ebda6e8892.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2.0\\quad \\text{(B) } 2.3\\quad \\text{(C) } 2.6\\quad \\text{(D) } 2.9\\quad \\text{(E) } 3.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"334\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> It is well known that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/c/c3c2697932cf8fa792ed50ee3b430726a8d8097a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T_n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />, so we can put this in and simplify to get that the general term of the product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/5/9652b04165ff35becb6566dc4d3e0a4f0334bffc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{(n+2)(n-1)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"120\" height=\"43\" /> Now by writing out the terms, we see that almost everything cancels (telescopes), giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/b/02b1627f59ea71b32e754118d2ca8a1b9e50aa8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3 \\times 1991}{1993}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> which is almost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/4540cfa31fc44e38f1fd3b152d69610b04a80bb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.9.$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w